    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "Joint press conference of American Foundation on Automation and Employment and Experiments in Art and Technology, held at 381 Lafayette Street, New York, N. Y.; includes announcement, original encased in plastic envelope, designed by Tom Gormley and Robert Rauschenberg (1 p.); \"Press Conference for E. A. T.\" announcement with background information (2 pp.);"
      },
      {
        "@value": "press release on the roles of each foundation (1 p.); \"Supporting Members of E.A.T.\" (1 p.); \"Remarks by Billy Kl\u00fcver\" (1 p.); \"Remarks by Herman D. Kenin\" (2 pp.); \"Remarks by John R. Pierce\" (1 p.); \"Excerpts from remarks by Ralph C. Gross\" (1 p.); \"Remarks by Warren Brody\" (2 pp.); \"Remarks by Robert Morris\" (2 pp.);"
      },
      {
        "@value": "\"Experiments in Art and Technology, Incorporated. Biographies of Board Members\" (1 p.); statement of purpose, on blue and white \"Clouds\" paper (1 p.) (Clouds paper designed by Robert Rauschenberg)."
      }
    ],
